  "name": "Slow Cooker Thai Curried Beef",
  "subtitle": "Tender beef in a coconut curry sauce with rice and greens.",
  "description": "Slow-cooked beef simmers with coconut milk, red curry, aromatics, and chile, then pairs with jasmine rice, spinach, and basil.",
